   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{AC1FB6F0C2CFA788}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "SITUATION"
     m_sContent "<b>Date:</b> 2019-08-17"\
     "<b>Location:</b> Javory, Bystrany"\
     ""\
     "Our cell is currently operating within and around Javory village, maintaining a low-profile presence among civilian infrastructure. The area is being used as a temporary logistics base to support our ongoing operations in the region."\
     ""\
     "Recent activity indicates increased pressure from government forces. Our civilian informants in nearby areas suggest a possible search operation may be imminent."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "FIA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{17A2966C8B19D45F}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "MISSION"
     m_sContent "FIA elements in Javory are tasked to:"\
     ""\
     "- <b>Defend 2x ammunition caches.</b>"\
     ""\
     "- Eliminate any and all attacking enemy forces."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "FIA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{D713662B13621CAC}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "FRIENDLY FORCES"
     m_sContent "FIA fighters are equipped with a mixture M81/OD camouflage. Most of our soldiers are supplied with modernized VZ-58 style rifles."\
     ""\
     "We also possess:"\
     ""\
     "- 1x MAT team"\
     ""\
     "- 1x MMG team"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "FIA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{53038B3F0198E2BA}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "ENEMY FORCES"
     m_sContent "Other nearby FIA cells have reported being attacked by a platoon sized AFRF light motorized infantry tactical detachment.  "\
     ""\
     "Our friends tell us that there may be a special forces element attached to said platoon."\
     ""\
     "Civilian informants positioned along the eastern MSR have told us that a convoy of GAZ Tigr vehicles with armed men inside has just passed them by. They are probably here for us."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "FIA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{0C299613954E2EA4}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "ADMIN & SUPPLY"
     m_sContent "FIA soldiers are equipped with their standard combat load."\
     ""\
     "Located inside Cache A building are:"\
     ""\
     "- 200x sandbags"\
     ""\
     "- 5x backpacks"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "FIA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{099FA26E84D1B78D}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "END CONDITIONS"
     m_sContent "- Both ammunition caches located and destroyed."\
     ""\
     "- Time limit exhausted."\
     ""\
     "- 85% of AFRF/SSO forces eliminated."\
     ""\
     "- 95% of FIA forces eliminated."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "FIA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{1CDACF0B81CFE32B}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "MM NOTES"
     m_sContent "<b>Time limit:</b> 60 minutes or until it gets boring."\
     ""\
     "You have been given sandbags, but you are <b>not allowed to place them in ways that would block people from accessing the cache locations.</b>"\
     ""\
     "Cache A is located inside a farm shed next to your spawn."\
     ""\
     "Cache B is located on the second floor of the church."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "FIA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{7471C775D70691D5}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "SITUATION"
     m_sContent "<b>Date:</b> 2019-08-17"\
     "<b>Location:</b> Javory, Bystrany"\
     ""\
     "Armed terrorist group known as the \"FIA\" has intensified it's operations in the Bystrany region. Intelligence confirms the presence of two ammunition caches, vital to their activities, within or on the outskirts of Javory village."\
     ""\
     "A mobile, reinforced platoon-sized tactical detachment has been deployed under battalion orders to exploit time-sensitive intelligence and eliminate key FIA logistical assets before they can be relocated."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{361831EC3BC959DE}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "SITUATION"
     m_sContent "A platoon-sized AFRF/SSO tactical detachment assaults Javory village to locate and destroy two ammunition caches belonging to an FIA cell operating in the area."\
     ""\
     "<b>RATIO: 2:1</b>"
     m_eAudience 1
    }
    GC_Briefing "{2F0B98623C2AFCAD}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "MISSION"
     m_sContent "Conduct a search and destroy operation in and around Javory in order to:"\
     ""\
     "- <b>Locate and destroy 2x ammunition caches.</b>"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{2A947947A072CACB}" {
     m_iOrder 10
     m_sTitle "FRIENDLY FORCES"
     m_sContent "A mixed, platoon-sized tactical detachment composed of conventional AFRF rifle elements reinforced with SSO teams. "\
     ""\
     "The unit is equipped with GAZ Tigr vehicles for mobility and local fire support. "
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{31155B820F4D14D1}" {
     m_iOrder 11
     m_sTitle "ENEMY FORCES"
     m_sContent "Intelligence estimates around 18-27 well trained and equipped FIA fighters to have taken up defences inside and around the village."\
     ""\
     "Enemy fighters have been spotted using <b>M81/OD</b> camouflage patterns, likely to be equipped with modernized VZ-58 style rifles and limited AT and MMG support. "
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{B83408D2DAD09271}" {
     m_iOrder 12
     m_sTitle "ADMIN & SUPPLY"
     m_sContent "AFRF and SSO soldiers are equipped with their standard combat load."\
     ""\
     "Tactical detachment currently has:"\
